          %h2#CoordinateSystemsLayerMod Abstract coordinate systems
          %p
            In this
            %a{:href => "#LayerMod"} Mod Layer
            we discuss the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/concrete+particulars"} concrete particulars
            of
            = succeed ":" do
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/coordinate+systems"} coordinate systems
