                    %mi CartSp
                    %mo →
                    %mi Set
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"}
                    A : CartSp \to Set
            %p
              is a
              = succeed "." do
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/smooth+algebra"} smooth algebra
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homomorphism"} homomorphism
              of smooth algebras is a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/natural+transformation"} natural transformation
              between the corresponding functors.
          %p The basic example is:
          #TheSmoothgAlgebraOfFunctionsOnACartesianSpace.num_example
            %h6#example_3 Example
            %p
              For
              = succeed "," do
